flowchart LR
  Gov[Governor / Timelock]\n(Governance Authority)
  Registry[AIOracleRegistry]
  Hub[AIAttestationHub]
  Guard[PolicyGuard]
  Target[Protocol Control Plane]\n(e.g., SlashingManager.setFeePolicy)
  Bypass[Explicit Governance Bypass]
  Evidence[EvidenceAnchor]
  UI[UI / Services]\n(read-only visibility)

  Gov -->|configure signers + policies| Registry
  Gov -->|set mode / bypass lists| Guard
  Gov -->|anchor model cards + reports| Evidence

  Registry -->|allowlist + thresholds| Hub
  Hub -->|latest attestations| Guard

  Guard -->|ENFORCE blocks| Target
  Guard -->|ADVISORY logs| Target
  Gov -->|override path| Bypass --> Target

  Hub -->|events| UI
  Registry -->|signers + policies| UI
  Guard -->|mode + evaluations| UI
  Evidence -->|anchored hashes| UI
